verything by command of its Lord. And they became so that nothing was seen [of them] except their dwellings. Thus do We recompense the criminal people.","j":26,"h":51,"s":46,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"46:26","t":"And We had certainly established them in such as We have not established you, and We made for them hearing and vision and hearts [i.e., intellect]. But their hearing and vision and hearts availed them not from anything [of the punishment] when they were [continually] rejecting the signs of Allāh; and they were enveloped by what they used to ridicule.","j":26,"h":51,"s":46,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"46:27","t":"And We have already destroyed what surrounds you of [those] cities, and We have diversified the signs [or verses] that perhaps they might return [from disbelief].","j":26,"h":51,"s":46,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"46:28","t":"Then why did those they took besides Allāh as deities by which to approach [Him] not aid them? But they had strayed [i.e., departed] from them. And that was their falsehood and what they were inventing.","j":26,"h":51,"s":46,"a":28,"sd":null}],"juz":26,"hizb":51,"surahs":[46],"sajdah":false}